  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2505.03 Presentation of Permit Upon Request. A person shall present a valid form DSMV 473 (Rev. 9/2025) upon request of:\n\n(a) Any law enforcement officer; or\n\n(b) Any inspection station which inspects the motor vehicle.\n\nSource. #4974, eff 11-13-90; ss by #6204, eff 3-15-96, EXPIRED: 3-15-04\n\nNew. #8072, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10083, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14218, INTERIM., eff 3-25-25; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35\n\n25; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
